{
  "title": "Vibrant Garlicky British Tomatoes Ploughmans Lunch",
  "description": "A traditional British dish originating from Yorkshire, this ploughman's lunch features garlicky, chewy, and flavorful ingredients, including tomatoes and bonito flakes, all shojin-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "British",
  "diet": [
